.SH "NAME"
frysk \- The Frysk Debugging, Tracing, and Monitoring Tool Suite
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
The Frysk Tool Suite provides a collection of command line and gnome utilities for the debugging, tracing, and monitoring of user programs\&.
